OL,3,GNEWSABlackburn double murder suspect
OL,4,Acharged
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with murdering
OL,7,Fan "inseparable" couple found dead in
OL,8,Ftheir own home.
OL,10,FPolice were called at 08:22 BST on
OL,11,FMonday to a property on Hardman Street
OL,12,Fin Blackburn and found Ismail Ahmed
OL,13,FYeli, 80, and 78-year-old Fatma Leli
OL,14,Fhad died from multiple stab wounds.
OL,16,FYasin Leli, 46, also of Hardman Street,
OL,17,Fwas charged with two counts of murder
OL,18,Fand is due to appear at Blackburn
OL,19,FMagistrates Court later.
